# MHP email contract

Read `docs/EMAIL.md` before adding or restyling any email. It is the source of
truth and overrides generic mail-design preferences.

- Compose HTML only with `composeTransactionalEmail()` in
  `src/features/email/layout.ts`. Deliver with `sendMail()`. Keep a plain-text
  part. Do not add a second mail provider.
- Same visual language as the site: pure white and black, gold only on the
  small uppercase eyebrow, editorial serif title, sans body and prices, 1px
  black rules. No beige, cream, bronze, brown, gradients, shadows, pills, or
  decorative images.
- Table layout and inline styles only. No Tailwind, flex, grid, or a second
  HTML template.
- Localize FR/DE/EN. Shared labels live in `Email.fields`.
- Buyer confirmation shows `organization.courseVenueAddress`, never the
  booking UUID. Staff mail may include the reference.
- Before completion, unit-test destination plus shared chrome and inspect the
  message in Mailpit.
